1/+1 counters on it to any target.","power":"5","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2011-04-01","toughness":"5","type_line":"Creature — Dragon"},{"cmc":7.0,"color_identity":["B"],"colors":["B"],"defense":null,"keywords":["Amplify","Trample"],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{6}{B}","name":"Zombie Brute","oracle_id":"377177f3-65e5-4909-bf12-48a473b1861d","oracle_text":"Amplify 1 (As this creature enters, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each Zombie card you reveal in your hand.)\nTrample","power":"5","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2003-02-03","toughness":"4","type_line":"Creature — Zombie"}],"fixture_kind":"amplify_originals","rulings":[{"comment":"Any enters abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Clone enters. Any \"as [this creature] enters\" or \"[this creature] enters with\" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Clone copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn't copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Clone's ability doesn't target the chosen creature.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If Clone somehow enters at the same time as another creature, Clone can't become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that's already on the battlefield.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature is a token, Clone copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is an Evil Twin), then Clone enters as whatever that creature copied.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clone enters as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The number of +1/+1 counters for the ability is checked when the ability resolves.","oracle_id":"7fc60ae2-75fc-49e1-9d56-aa5a43844210","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Each additional Hardened Scales you control will increase the number of +1/+1 counters placed on a creature you control by one.","oracle_id":"a1f3da21-af6d-450e-bf0b-985d158418e6","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a creature you control would enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it, it enters with that many plus one instead.","oracle_id":"a1f3da21-af6d-450e-bf0b-985d158418e6","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If two or more effects attempt to modify how many counters would be put on a creature you control, you choose the order to apply those effects, no matter who controls the sources of those effects.","oracle_id":"a1f3da21-af6d-450e-bf0b-985d158418e6","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Pinned Amplify originals and entry interaction controls."}
